    "title": "Texas nonprofit marks 49 years of changing lives - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Briannagh Dennehy ,\n1 days ago ABILENE, Texas — The Regional Victim Crisis Center marked 49 years of supporting survivors of sexual assault and other violent crimes, recognizing the community partnerships that help sustain its work across Abilene and the Big Country. Community members, first responders, and local partners gathered for an afternoon of food, music, and conversation to celebrate the nonprofit’s milestone. Read full article",
